WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.170
The Qur'an tells Muslims
to establish prayer.

2
00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:06.270
But it does not list every
movement, every word,

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.990
or the number of units in each prayer.

4
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:13.530
Zakah, the giving to the
poor, is set at 2.5 per cent.

5
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.020
That figure is not in the Qur'an either.

6
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.500
So where do Muslims learn the rest?

7
00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.460
In this mission, you'll
open up a single report,

8
00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:25.500
recorded more than a thousand
years ago, and see how it is built.

9
00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:30.750
Then you'll compare how Sunni and Shi'a
Muslims decide which reports to trust,

10
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.180
and weigh up whether Islam
could be practised without them.

11
00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:39.550
Your mission: find out where Muslims learn
how to live out what the Qur'an teaches.
